subgraph WHAT["0 · THE PROBLEM"]
    direction TB
    W1["Smooth motion updates every frame.<br/>Hand-drawn and stop-motion animation<br/>hold each pose for 2-3 frames — 'on twos'."]
    W2["Goal: quantise motion in TIME<br/>without touching the thing producing it.<br/>Animator, IK and physics keep running at full rate;<br/>only what is DRAWN is held."]
    W3["Two hard constraints:<br/>1 CAUSAL — no lookahead, this is live<br/>2 NON-INVASIVE — the held pose must never<br/>enter the physics solver's state"]
